2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2395) 'World grid and project settings
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2395  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2395) '- The world-locked grid `addons/procedural_3d_grid/core/procedural_grid_3d.tscn` is instanced under `World` at the floor.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2395  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2395) '- `project.godot`: `xr/openxr/reference_space=2` (local floor) and `xr/openxr/extensions/hand_tracking=true`. The action map gains `/interaction_profiles/ext/hand_interaction_ext` with `trigger` on pinch and `aim_pose`. Godot master has no Frame controller profile, so the gate logs each hand's `get_tracker_profile()` and the logbook records the measured binding.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2395  1 LINE
 Text:Written

