2026-10-31T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2395) '- `tools/gate_replay.gd` gets its control: `skirt.usda`'s `customLayerData` carries `expected = {cycles: 2, openings: 2}` (regenerated by `tools/make_skirt.gd`), and `--control=drop_seam` drops the stroke `seam_back` in `_author` before `StrokesUsd.events` and must fail at MESH.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2395  1 LINE
 Text:Written

