2026-10-31T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2395) 'Check: the replay passes headless on the double build and on the Frame in priority mode (six strokes, two cycles, two openings). The Lean tests in &{repo("interactor-lasso")}'s `tests/lasso` pass with their controls; `elixir tools/build.exs --no-elfs --gates=load,crossings`. Controls: `drop_seam` fails, `hidden` and `flat --expect=xr` fail, and priority off draws nothing.
 # tags: rfd:details
